# Video

The video element (0.37.0): a player with a poster, a caption and playback
flags; a hero with a background video; an embed that names a video file; and
library references (`media:`) that draw the placeholder until a host
resolves them.

::video[src="/media/intro.mp4" poster="/img/intro.jpg" caption="How a claim works" alt="A phone showing the claim screen" aspect="16/9"]
::

